---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionTitle from "../../components/SectionTitle.astro";
import { site } from "../../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="Join">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Join TML</p>
      <h1>Students interested in trustworthy AI are welcome to contact us.</h1>
      <p>
        TML looks for students who enjoy rigorous research, careful engineering,
        and problems that connect AI reliability with real systems.
      </p>
      <p lang="ko">
        신뢰할 수 있는 AI, Foundation Models, 자율주행/VLA, 언러닝, 프라이버시,
        양자/분산 계산 기반 연구에 관심 있는 학생들의 연락을 환영합니다.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split-content">
      <div>
        <SectionTitle title="Open Positions" />
        <p>
          TML welcomes inquiries from prospective graduate students and
          undergraduate researchers interested in trustworthy AI. Graduate study
          may include bachelor's-master's integrated, master's, and
          master's-Ph.D. integrated tracks.
        </p>
        <p>
          Research opportunities connect to reliable computing, foundation models,
          autonomous driving, machine unlearning, quantum machine learning, and
          safe generative AI.
        </p>
        <p lang="ko">
          대학원 진학, 학석사연계, 석사, 석박통합, 학부 연구생에 관심 있는 학생은
          관심 연구 주제와 수행한 프로젝트, 논문, 코드 경험을 간단히 정리해 연락해 주세요.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-panel">
        <h2>What We Look For</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Strong interest in trustworthy machine learning</li>
          <li>Careful reading and writing habits</li>
          <li>Solid programming and experimental discipline</li>
          <li>Willingness to work across theory, systems, and applications</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="info-panel">
        <h2>Research Areas</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Reliable computing and verifiable computation</li>
          <li>LLMs, generative AI, and multimodal models</li>
          <li>Autonomous driving, Vision-Language-Action (VLA), and embodied AI</li>
          <li>Unlearning, privacy, robustness, alignment, and explainability</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="info-panel">
        <h2>Location</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Professor office: {site.office}</li>
          <li>Student lab: {site.studentLab}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <SectionTitle title="How To Apply" />
        <p>
          Send a concise email describing your background, research interests,
          and relevant projects or papers.
        </p>
        <p lang="ko">
          이메일에는 자기소개, 관심 있는 TML 연구 주제, 관련 프로젝트나 논문/코드 링크를
          함께 적어주면 좋습니다.
        </p>
        <a class="button primary" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>Contact {site.email}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
